{"4218970": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Autobahn Police Simulator 4", "steam_appid": 4218970, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218970/extras/49e02a9763026470f55c4aa4d813aa4f.avif?t=1786528402\" width=781 height=66 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218970/extras/c8b1b7bf1892d53878dd58090829381e.avif?t=1786528402\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218970/extras_big/c8b1b7bf1892d53878dd58090829381e.avif?t=1786528402 width=1560 height=252 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the German  police on the Autobahn and keep the roads safe in a fully drivable open world: unrestricted highways, winding country roads and lively towns. In <i>Autobahn Police Simulator 4</i> you'll experience police duty in more depth than ever before. Conduct traffic stops, secure accident scenes and give chase when a suspect makes a run for it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218970/extras/8da5235d885c3ec9d160983e3af02017.avif?t=1786528402\" width=781 height=67 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218970/extras/6fc203dee5b9e5b6d1b015a555d9e014.avif?t=1786528402\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218970/extras_big/6fc203dee5b9e5b6d1b015a555d9e014.avif?t=1786528402 width=1560 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Patrol a fully drivable open world in a range of police vehicles, from the standard patrol car to an unmarked unit. Highways with rest stops and gas stations meet industrial zones, residential neighborhoods and small towns nestled between forests and mountains.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218970/extras/d2eb5fb9d6a984fb9aaddde01ef33c51.avif?t=1786528402\" width=781 height=66 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218970/extras/f989a7ad8a1bd1f4b623431db0ed47d8.avif?t=1786528402\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218970/extras_big/f989a7ad8a1bd1f4b623431db0ed47d8.webp?t=1786528402 width=1560 height=252 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The radio calls, and you decide how to respond. Whether it's a routine stop, accident assistance or a high-speed pursuit with lights and sirens: every call brings new challenges. Act by the book and succeed on duty to earn reputation, climb the ranks and unlock new vehicles, equipment and police stations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience daily life as a German  officer on the Autobahn up close</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open world: highways, country roads, industrial and residential areas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traffic stops with document and vehicle checks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide range of calls and radio dispatches, from routine stops to high-speed pursuits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special operations and optional side missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple unlockable police stations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of police vehicles, including an unmarked unit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reputation and progression system</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218970/extras/49e02a9763026470f55c4aa4d813aa4f.avif?t=1786528402\" width=781 height=66 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218970/extras/c8b1b7bf1892d53878dd58090829381e.avif?t=1786528402\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218970/extras_big/c8b1b7bf1892d53878dd58090829381e.avif?t=1786528402 width=1560 height=252 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the German  police on the Autobahn and keep the roads safe in a fully drivable open world: unrestricted highways, winding country roads and lively towns. In <i>Autobahn Police Simulator 4</i> you'll experience police duty in more depth than ever before. Conduct traffic stops, secure accident scenes and give chase when a suspect makes a run for it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218970/extras/8da5235d885c3ec9d160983e3af02017.avif?t=1786528402\" width=781 height=67 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218970/extras/6fc203dee5b9e5b6d1b015a555d9e014.avif?t=1786528402\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218970/extras_big/6fc203dee5b9e5b6d1b015a555d9e014.avif?t=1786528402 width=1560 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Patrol a fully drivable open world in a range of police vehicles, from the standard patrol car to an unmarked unit. Highways with rest stops and gas stations meet industrial zones, residential neighborhoods and small towns nestled between forests and mountains.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218970/extras/d2eb5fb9d6a984fb9aaddde01ef33c51.avif?t=1786528402\" width=781 height=66 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218970/extras/f989a7ad8a1bd1f4b623431db0ed47d8.avif?t=1786528402\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218970/extras_big/f989a7ad8a1bd1f4b623431db0ed47d8.webp?t=1786528402 width=1560 height=252 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The radio calls, and you decide how to respond. Whether it's a routine stop, accident assistance or a high-speed pursuit with lights and sirens: every call brings new challenges. Act by the book and succeed on duty to earn reputation, climb the ranks and unlock new vehicles, equipment and police stations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience daily life as a German  officer on the Autobahn up close</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open world: highways, country roads, industrial and residential areas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traffic stops with document and vehicle checks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide range of calls and radio dispatches, from routine stops to high-speed pursuits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special operations and optional side missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple unlockable police stations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of police vehicles, including an unmarked unit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reputation and progression system</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Experience daily police duty on Germany's Autobahn like never before and keep the peace in a living open world. From traffic stop